exports[`Today's states SNAPSHOT blocked: the engine's line, verbatim, and yesterday's briefing labelled stale 1`] = `"<section class="today"><h2 class="svelte-1wrd726">Today</h2> <div class="badge warn svelte-1wrd726">Blocked — repos need access</div> <p class="banner warn svelte-1wrd726">blocked: 2 repos could not be read (&lt;img src=x onerror="alert(1)">); not marking today done</p> <div class="actions svelte-1wrd726"><button class="svelte-1wrd726">Run now</button> <span class="hint svelte-1wrd726">Generates today's briefing if it has not been generated yet and your morning time has passed.</span></div> <p class="state stale svelte-1wrd726">This is the most recent briefing, from 2026-09-15 — not today's. Today's has not been generated yet; the status above says why.</p> <article class="briefing svelte-1b2ihq2"><h3 class="b title svelte-1b2ihq2" data-block="">☀️ Daily briefing — 2026-09-15 (this machine: mac)</h3><h4 class="b heading svelte-1b2ihq2" data-block="">Where you left off</h4><p class="b bullet svelte-1b2ihq2" data-block="">[app] resume &lt;img src=x onerror="alert(1)"></p><h4 class="b heading svelte-1b2ihq2" data-block="">What you did — 1 commit</h4><p class="b bullet svelte-1b2ihq2" data-block="">[app] shipped the thing (<code class="sha svelte-1b2ihq2">abc1234</code>)</p><h4 class="b heading svelte-1b2ihq2" data-block="">Suggested next</h4><p class="b bullet svelte-1b2ihq2" data-block="">next step</p><p class="b footer svelte-1b2ihq2" data-block="">— generated via claude</p></article></section>"`;

